  "readme": "# Warm Meow Morandi\n\nVersion 0.3.9 uses the user-selected middle landscape expansion and adds verified component-level surfaces and contrast tokens for sidebar states, project hover cards, settings cards and navigation, summary panel, slash-command menu, change status, breadcrumbs, and running-state shimmer.\n\n## Design contract\n\n- Layout: `native-immersive`; native Codex geometry and interaction remain intact.\n- Artwork: visible on home and conversation workspaces, with the seven-cat cluster preserved in the rightmost third.\n- Palette: low-saturation Morandi warm greige, muted khaki, dusty sage, stone, graphite, ivory, and a restrained dusty blue focus color.\n- Text-safe region: left 62%.\n- Viewports: 1440×900 and 980×760.\n\n## Asset note\n\nThe source illustration was supplied by the user. The landscape expansion and Morandi color grade were generated with the built-in image generation/editing tool. No upload or publication was performed.\n\n## Verification\n\nThe included previews are privacy-safe design previews. Real-app activation and route-by-route readability auditing require explicit approval.\n",
